# Unified diagnostic node manifest — single source of truth.
# See docs/UNIFIED-DIAGNOSTIC-UI-DESIGN.md.
# Fields: id|parent|layer|title|side|risk|repair|auto|ui_slot|gap
# parent empty = layer root. status is derived live, never stored here.
1||1|Workstation reaches router|xstation|safe|local_route|none|path|
2||2|Router platform files installed|router|disruptive|install|none|path|
3||3|Router uplink has internet|router|disruptive|uplink_reselect|hotplug|path|G2
4||4|Router Xray runtime up|router|disruptive|restart_runtime|watchdog|path|
4.1|4|4|Transparent proxy (redsocks + nat)|router|disruptive|transproxy_restart|watchdog|path|
5||5|Router to VPS transport (WS+TLS)|router|disruptive|repin_render|watchdog+repin|path|
6||6|VPS Xray runtime|vps|disruptive|repair_pipeline|none|vps|
7||7|End-to-end: LAN client to internet via VPS|router|disruptive|walk|none|path|
8||8|Config coherence (profile = router = VPS)|router|disruptive|apply_profile|none|config|
8.5|8|8|Transport matches VPS|router|disruptive|rerender|none|config|
R||R|Template rendering (build-time)|build|safe|fix_renderer|none|config|
9||9|Install pipeline|xstation|disruptive|reinstall|none|path|
